OL,3,GNEWSAPaddy McGuinness turns on
OL,4,ABlackpool Illuminations
OL,5,
OL,6,FTV comedian Paddy McGuinness has turned
OL,7,Fon the Blackpool Illuminations in front
OL,8,Fof 25,000 people.
OL,10,FThe BBC Radio 2 presenter and Phoenix
OL,11,FNights star flicked the switch at 21:15
OL,12,FBST to mark the official start of this
OL,13,Fyear's spectacular light show.
OL,15,FThere were huge cheers as the Blackpool
OL,16,FTower was lit up, with confetti cannons
OL,17,Fand fireworks set off as the Lancashire
OL,18,Fresort celebrated switch-on.
OL,20,FMcGuinness told BBC Radio Lancashire
OL,21,Fsaid it was "amazing" and "Blackpool is
OL,22,Fworld famous".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
